=head2 Username => Str

The user's username.


=head2 UserStatus => Str

The user status. This can be one of the following:

=over

=item *

C<UNCONFIRMED>: User has been created but not confirmed.

=item *

C<CONFIRMED>: User has been confirmed.

=item *

C<EXTERNAL_PROVIDER>: User signed in with a third-party IdP.

=item *

C<RESET_REQUIRED>: User is confirmed, but the user must request a code
and reset their password before they can sign in.

=item *

C<FORCE_CHANGE_PASSWORD>: The user is confirmed and the user can sign
in using a temporary password, but on first sign-in, the user must
change their password to a new value before doing anything else.

=back

The statuses C<ARCHIVED>, C<UNKNOWN>, and C<COMPROMISED> are no longer
used.



